# 🍽️ The Chef & Table — Website Complete Overview

## 🏗️ Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend ["Frontend (React + Vite)"]
        direction TB
        A["🏠 Home Page"] --> N["Navbar"]
        B["📋 Menu Page"] --> N
        C["ℹ️ About Page"] --> N
        D["📞 Contact Page"] --> N
        E["🔑 Login/Register"] --> N
        F["🛒 Cart Page"] --> N
        G["📝 Order Form / Checkout"] --> N
        H["🔐 Admin Panel"]
    end

    subgraph Backend ["Backend (Express.js)"]
        direction TB
        API1["POST /api/auth/register"]
        API2["POST /api/auth/login"]
        API3["POST /api/admin/login"]
        API4["CRUD /api/orders"]
        API5["CRUD /api/food"]
        API6["GET/DELETE /api/users"]
    end

    subgraph Database ["Database (MongoDB)"]
        DB1["Users Collection"]
        DB2["Orders Collection"]
        DB3["FoodItems Collection"]
    end

    Frontend -->|API Calls| Backend
    Backend -->|Mongoose| Database
```

---

## 📄 All Pages & Routes

| # | Route | Page | Description |
|---|-------|------|-------------|
| 1 | `/#/` | **Home** | Landing page with hero section, explore menu, table booking, testimonials, contact form, footer |
| 2 | `/#/menu` | **Menu** | Full menu with category/subcategory filters, search, and "Add to Cart" |
| 3 | `/#/about` | **About** | About the restaurant + Team section |
| 4 | `/#/contact` | **Contact** | Contact form for customer queries |
| 5 | `/#/login` | **Login/Register** | User authentication (login + registration) |
| 6 | `/#/card2` | **Cart** | Shopping cart with items added from menu |
| 7 | `/#/orderform` | **Checkout** | Order form with delivery details, payment, order summary |
| 8 | `/#/admin` | **Admin Panel** | Full admin dashboard (login required) |
| 9 | `/#/explore` | **Explore** | Explore food categories |

---

## 🎯 Feature Breakdown

### 🏠 Home Page (`/`)
- Animated hero section with parallax mouse effect
- "Explore Menu" CTA button
- Sections: Explore → Booking → Hero2 → Side → Contact Form → Footer
- Scroll progress bar at top
- Responsive navbar with mobile drawer

### 📋 Menu Page (`/menu`)
- **18 food items** with images, descriptions, prices
- **8 Categories**: Starters, Pizza, Pasta, Burgers, Main Course, Indian, Desserts, Beverages
- **Sub-categories**: e.g., Starters → Bread, Chinese, Chicken
- Search bar to filter items by name
- Category filter buttons → Subcategory appears when a category is selected
- "Add to Cart" on each card
- Veg/Non-Veg badge on each item

### 🛒 Cart Page (`/card2`)
- Shows all items added to cart (Redux store)
- Quantity display
- Remove item functionality
- Proceed to checkout

### 📝 Checkout / Order Form (`/orderform`)
- **Login required** — redirects to login if not authenticated
- Form fields: Full Name, Phone, Address, Order Notes
- Payment: Cash on Delivery (COD)
- Order summary with subtotal, delivery fee (₹20), taxes (5%), total
- On success: shows Order ID + items ordered
- Orders saved to MongoDB via backend API

### 🔑 Login / Register (`/login`)
- **Login** with username & password
- **Register** new account
- User session stored in `localStorage`
- Auth state synced via custom `authChange` event

### 🔐 Admin Panel (`/admin`)
- **Admin Login**: Default credentials `admin / admin123`
- **4 Tabs** in vertical left sidebar:

| Tab | Features |
|-----|----------|
| **Dashboard** | Stats cards (Total Orders, Revenue, Menu Items, Users) + Monthly Orders Bar Chart (Recharts) |
| **Manage Menu** | View all food items, search, edit, delete, add new items. Base items from [item.js](file:///c:/foodapp-main/foodapp-main/foodapp/src/components/Menu/item.js) can be edited/reset |
| **Customer Orders** | View all orders, update status (Pending → Preparing → Out for Delivery → Delivered → Cancelled), delete orders |
| **Registered Users** | View all registered users, delete users |

- Sidebar bottom: "Go to Website" and "Logout Admin" buttons

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| **Frontend** | React 19, Vite 8, React Router DOM 7 |
| **State Management** | Redux Toolkit |
| **Animations** | Framer Motion, GSAP |
| **Charts** | Recharts |
| **Icons** | React Icons (Lu, Fa) |
| **Styling** | Vanilla CSS (Dark Premium Theme) |
| **Backend** | Express.js, Node.js |
| **Database** | MongoDB (Mongoose ODM) |
| **Dev Tools** | Concurrently (run frontend + backend together) |

---

## 🔌 Backend API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|--------|----------|---------|
| `GET` | `/api/health` | Health check |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/login` | Admin authentication |
| `GET` | `/api/food` | Get all food items |
| `POST` | `/api/food` | Create food item |
| `PUT` | `/api/food/:id` | Update food item |
| `DELETE` | `/api/food/:id` | Delete food item |
| `GET` | `/api/orders` | Get all orders |
| `POST` | `/api/orders` | Create new order |
| `PUT` | `/api/orders/:id` | Update order status |
| `DELETE` | `/api/orders/:id` | Delete order |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Register new user |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | User login |
| `GET` | `/api/users` | Get all users |
| `DELETE` | `/api/users/:id` | Delete user |

---

