## 🚀 How to Run

```bash
cd foodapp-main
npm install          # Install concurrently
npm run dev          # Starts both frontend (5173) + backend (5000)
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> MongoDB must be running locally on `mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/foodapp` for orders, users, and food CRUD to work.

